ouncements\nView All\nPrincipal's Desk\nDr. Rupeswar Chetia\nRead more\nAbout College\nWelcome to\nSubansiri College, Lakhimpur (Estd. 1997), a premier higher educational institution has been striving for excellence as a goal in the field of teaching learning process with an emphasis of developing cognitive, conative and affective domains of the learners in the area.\nThe college is located at a quite green natural and Ecological surrounding and is situated at Nagaon Milanpur in the west part of Gogamukh and it falls in the district of Lakhimpur. It is about 1.5 km. away from Gogamukh town and conveniently accessed by rickshaw or motor vehicle also walkable distance. The roadside College is followed by NH-15 in the south and Railway in the North with distinct visual geographical setup.\nRead more\nTenders\nView All\nAcademic Calender\nLearn More\nCollege Magazine\nLearn More\nDownloads\nLearn More\nIQAC\nLearn More\nMoU\nLearn More\nNSS\nLearn More\nEvents\nView All\nAchievement\nView All\nPhoto Gallery\nView All\nVideo Gallery\nView All\nImportant Links\nUGC\nGauhati University\nAICTE\nIGNOU\nDHE, Assam\nNAAC\nKKHSOU\nSubansiri College\nP.O- S.K. Adarsha(Pathalipam),\nP.S.- Chauldhowa\nDistrict-Lakhimpur, State - Assam\nPin - 787056\nsubansiricollege1997@gmail.com\n6001744114/9365774853\n-\nAbout Us\nPrincipal\nMotto & Vision\nAbout College\nNotices\nTenders\n-\nQuick Links\nLibrary\nAcademic Calendar\nNSS\n-\nLocate Us\nAll Rights Reserved | Copyright Â© 2026 Subansiri College | Powered by\nS.S. Technologies", "links": [{"label": "NVSP", "url": "https://voters.eci.gov.in/"}, {"label": "AQAR", "url": "https://www.subansiricollege.org/aqar.php"}, {"label": "SSR", "url": "https://www.subansiricollege.org/ssr.php"}, {"label": "NIRF", "url": "https://www.subansiricollege.org/nirf.php"}, {"label": "AISHE", "url": "https://www.subansiricollege.org/aishe.php"}, {"label": "PROSPECTUS", "url": "https://www.subansiricollege.org/upload/prospectus/1747374656.pdf"}, {"label": "